  "Restore…": "Restaurer…",
  "Restoring changes which servers Rivulet searches — a backup carries its own source list, and it wins.": "Restaurer modifie les serveurs que Rivulet consulte — une sauvegarde embarque sa propre liste de sources, et c'est elle qui gagne.",
  "Restrict content by age rating. A PIN prevents changes without authorization.": "TODO_TRANSLATION: Restrict content by age rating. A PIN prevents changes without authorization.",
  "Results for “{query}”": "Résultats pour « {query} »",
